{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 3-6 hour\u00a0<strong>action adventure game</strong> (written by S.D. Smith), you play as the young rabbit, Helmer. Determined to reclaim his family farm, Helmer must  <strong>fight</strong> his way out of <strong>the Dragon Tomb</strong>.\u00a0Backed by over 2,600 Kickstarter supporters, this first-ever Green Ember game brings the world to life for fans old and new.<br><br>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth and Combat</strong><br>Stay out of sight of patrolling guards or face them head-on. Use your\u00a0<strong>fists to pummel</strong>, your\u00a0<strong>sword to slash</strong>, or the\u00a0<strong>environment to bonk enemies</strong>\u00a0over the noggin'.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Enemies</strong><br>Battle swarms of\u00a0<strong>bats</strong>, fearsome\u00a0<strong>Nightwalkers</strong>, powerful\u00a0<strong>bosses</strong>, and uncover a\u00a0<strong>mysterious force pulling strings behind the scenes</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and Exploration</strong><br>Navigate a dangerous underground dungeon full of brain-teasing challenges.\u00a0<strong>Move boxes, pull levers, leap across collapsing platforms</strong>, and ride\u00a0<strong>ore buckets</strong>\u00a0through an ancient pulley system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot and Secrets</strong><br><strong>Crack open treasure chests</strong>\u00a0hidden deep in the dungeon to find\u00a0<strong>valuable loot</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue and Progression</strong><br><strong>Save prisoners</strong>,\u00a0<strong>evade or defeat enemies</strong>, and\u00a0<strong>respawn at save points</strong>\u00a0when you're overwhelmed. Every scar moves you nearer to legendary status and\u00a0every step brings you closer to the farm you love. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras/ce58c70cbd2f8cabc94e72e3a7a902de.avif?t=1773877743\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras_big/ce58c70cbd2f8cabc94e72e3a7a902de.avif?t=1773877743 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras/95e3a50ea9a25323256bd646f18ea516.avif?t=1773877743\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras_big/95e3a50ea9a25323256bd646f18ea516.avif?t=1773877743 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras/0227df5b04763993b84912ad23607bb9.avif?t=1773877743\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras_big/0227df5b04763993b84912ad23607bb9.avif?t=1773877743 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras/cd561a5e247036507384452c249e2d36.avif?t=1773877743\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/extras_big/cd561a5e247036507384452c249e2d36.avif?t=1773877743 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Download this thrilling adventure set deep in the world of the best-selling\u00a0<i>Green Ember</i>\u00a0series!  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680420?t=1773877743","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680420/beba7928f9ed3100dbbae9c3294aac9d03da3792/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773877743","capsule_image":"http